SUMMARY:Big Bear ROMP — LGBTQ+ Weekend
LOCATION:Holiday Inn Resort\, The Lodge at Big Bear Lake — 40650 Village 
 Dr\, Big Bear Lake\, CA 92315
DESCRIPTION:A four-day LGBTQ+ resort takeover in the Village: pool parties\
 , themed dance nights\, a lake cruise\, comedy\, drag bingo and trivia\, a
 ll based out of the Holiday Inn Resort.\n\nWHEN\nThu\, Aug 13–Sun\, Aug 
 16\, 2026 (all day)\n\nPRICE / ADMISSION\n• Weekend Pass covers all sche
 duled events Thursday through Sunday\n• Free Hotel Access Pass lets you 
 buy individual event tickets on-site\n• Some events are walk-up priced\,
  such as $20 for the Sunday pool party\n• Exact weekend-pass pricing is 
 not published on the organizer's schedule page\n\nSCHEDULE\n• Sunday 7:0
 0–10:00 AM — Morning Mischief in the host hotel lobby\, complimentary\
 n• Sunday 10:00 AM–5:00 PM — Last Splash Pool Party\, included with 
 a pass or $20 walk-up\n• Sunday 11:00 AM–1:00 PM — Drag Bingo in the
  Ball-Room\, included\n• Sunday 5:00 PM — Diehards & Stayouts Party at
  Whiskey Dave's\, no pass required\n• Sunday 5:00–10:00 PM — Open Mi
 c Night at Stillwell's Bar\, no pass required\n\nWHAT TO EXPECT\n• Weeke
 nd programming includes a Big Bear Queen lake cruise\, the BEEFWITCH dance
  party\, a Bear Soup pool party\, Mountains of Laughs comedy night\, ROMP 
 In The Dark\, and bingo and trivia nights\n• The game room\, hot tub and
  pool run long hours through the weekend\n• Several Sunday events are op
 en without any pass\, including the Whiskey Dave's party and open mic\n\nU
 SEFUL NOTES\n• The no-pass-required Sunday events at Whiskey Dave's and 
 Stillwell's are the easiest way to drop in on the weekend without buying a
 nything\n• The host hotel reliably sells out well in advance for this we
 ekend\, which is worth knowing when planning lodging in mid-August\n\nTBD 
 / VERIFY BEFORE GOING\n• The organizer's own schedule page is marked sub
 ject to change and was missing the full Saturday listing when checked\n•
  Weekend-pass and individual-event pricing are not published on the schedu
 le page\; see the Eventbrite listing\n\nOFFICIAL SOURCES\n• Official eve
 nt schedule: https://www.bigbearromp.com/event-schedule\n• Registration 
 and passes: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/big-bear-romp-2026-tickets-198933
 6393705\n\nCALENDAR STATUS: DETAILS_TBD\nLast checked: 2026-08-15\nDetails
  can change. Recheck the official source before making a special trip.
URL:https://www.bigbearromp.com/event-schedule
CATEGORIES:LGBTQ+,Festival,Nightlife,Village,TBD
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-BIGBEAR-DETAIL-STATUS:DETAILS_TBD
END:VEVENT
