UID:doo-dah-parade-2026@big-bear-events.bry.rip
DTSTAMP:20260815T150000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260815T150000Z
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T150000
SUMMARY:Fawnskin Doo Dah Parade — 50th Anniversary
LOCATION:Fawnskin Fire Station to the Moose Lodge — 39188 Rim of the Worl
 d Dr\, Fawnskin\, CA 92333
DESCRIPTION:Fifty years of small-town silliness: a quarter-mile parody of t
 he Rose Parade where the entry requirements are a costume and a straight f
 ace. Anyone can join on the spot\, and participants get a wacky swag bag.\
 n\nWHEN\nSat\, Aug 15\, 2026\, 10:00 AM–3:00 PM\n\nPRICE / ADMISSION\n
 • Free to watch and free to march — no entry fee either way\n• Food 
 and vendor booths sold separately\; proceeds support Moose charities\n\nSC
 HEDULE\n• 9:00–9:45 AM — lineup at the Fawnskin Fire Station\n• 10
 :00–10:45 AM — parade travels through downtown Fawnskin to the Moose L
 odge\n• 10:00 AM–3:00 PM — mini petting zoo\, food and vendor booths
 \, fire trucks to climb and ride\, and live music after the parade\n\nWHAT
  TO EXPECT\n• The route is barely a quarter-mile end to end\; it was onc
 e billed as the world's shortest parade\n• Entries are deliberately absu
 rd — costumes\, decorated vehicles\, questionable themes\n• No pre-reg
 istration is required\; show up at the fire station during lineup with an 
 idea\n• The Moose Lodge and fire station plaza carry the day after the p
 arade ends\n\nUSEFUL NOTES\n• This is the low-effort\, high-payoff optio
 n for a visiting friend: free\, walkable\, over by 11\, and unmistakably l
 ocal\n• Fawnskin is on the north shore\, about 15 minutes from the Villa
 ge\n• Entry questions: Denise Marsicano\, 323-251-2829 or Denisemarsican
 o965@gmail.com\n\nCONFLICTS / SAME-DAY OPTIONS\n• Overlaps or competes w
 ith: Conquer the Wall — Uphill Race (Sat\, Aug 15\, 2026 at 9:00 AM).\n
 • Overlaps or competes with: SkyFest Big Bear — Saturday (Sat\, Aug 15
 \, 2026\, 12:00 PM–11:00 PM).\n\nOFFICIAL SOURCES\n• Big Bear Grizzly 
 50th-anniversary coverage: https://www.bigbeargrizzly.net/news/doodah-para
 de-celebrates-50-years-of-small-town-silliness/article_3819c0ad-d6f9-4eac-
 8178-467e04d046b0.html\n• Fawnskin community site: https://www.fawnskin.
 org/\n\nCALENDAR STATUS: CONFIRMED\nLast checked: 2026-08-15\nDetails can 
 change. Recheck the official source before making a special trip.
URL:https://www.bigbeargrizzly.net/news/doodah-parade-celebrates-50-years-o
 f-small-town-silliness/article_3819c0ad-d6f9-4eac-8178-467e04d046b0.html
CATEGORIES:Parade,Free,Family,Community
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-BIGBEAR-DETAIL-STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
