 rfest/2024-oktoberfest-entertainment-schedule/\n• Opening-weekend ticket
 s: https://bigbearevents.ticketsauce.com/e/2026-big-bear-oktoberfest-weeke
 nd-1/tickets\n• Official hours and policies: https://bigbearevents.com/o
 ktoberfest/tickets-3/\n\nCALENDAR STATUS: CONFIRMED\nLast checked: 2026-08
