SUMMARY:Summer Concert Series — Bardo + Mestizo Beat
LOCATION:The Village concert stage — Pine Knot Ave & Village Dr\, Big Bea
 r Lake\, CA 92315
DESCRIPTION:The sleeper show for soulful guitar and deep grooves: Bardo and
  Mestizo Beat bring Afro-Latino soul\, early-’70s funk\, Latin jazz\, Af
 robeat\, psychedelic rock\, cumbia and classic R&B to the Village.\n\nWHEN
 \nSat\, Sep 12\, 2026\, 5:30 PM–8:30 PM\n\nPRICE / ADMISSION\n• Free\n
 • All ages\n\nSCHEDULE\n• 5:30 PM — event area opens with family gam
 es and a nonprofit beer garden\n• 6:00–7:15 PM — first published mus
 ic slot\n• 7:30–8:30 PM — second published music slot\n\nWHAT TO EXP
 ECT\n• Bardo\, the former Chicano Batman frontman\, draws on Afro-Latino
  heritage\, classic rock\, R&B\, cumbia\, vallenato and salsa\n• Mestizo
  Beat is an instrumental Afro-Latin soul ensemble mixing early-’70s funk
  and soul\, Latin jazz\, Afrobeat\, psychedelic rock and hip-hop\n• The 
 City has not explicitly assigned either artist to one of the two time slot
 s\n\nUSEFUL NOTES\n• Village public lots are available but fill\; the Ci
 ty recommends the free Mountain Transit Red\, Blue and Gold lines\n\nTBD /
  VERIFY BEFORE GOING\n• Which artist plays the 6:00 slot and which plays
